From db513003bc5d8e7c374d9ba44599305b738adf8d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 08:25:14 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Show the whole practice review, classify E/M, and export it
 to Excel

The post-submit review listed only what lost points. Every chart now
carries a classified side-by-side of key and coder, line by line, built
once in services/practice_review and rendered by the trainer Review
modal, the coder results screen and a new .xlsx export.

E/M and ED Profee get their own sections (level, primary and secondary
Dx, CPT) and the MDM tables element by element, so a partial reasoning
score such as 6.7 of 10 shows which element it lost. Display only: no
score changes.

