From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 08:32:40 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Show E/M diagnoses as one scored section, and pass the schema
 guards

The E/M Dx score sat beside an 'order only' badge on a Primary section
and read as a deduction for order, which the grader never makes. It is
one component, so it is now one Diagnoses section with the primary as
a row and a note naming what the points are for.

Also: the review's Excel writer is registered with the house-style
guard (its extra/differs fills join excel_style), and a test fixture no
longer writes 1 into a boolean column, which PostgreSQL rejects.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01GAgNTxNNybv6W7GXL33G6z
